        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this comfortable 2 bed apartment enjoying a fabulous location within Dungarvan's vibrant town centre. No. 22 which is located on the second floor has the benefit of lift access and adjacent public parking (residents street parking permits available). This apartment enjoys an exceptional setting only metres from Dungarvan Harbour and is surrounded by a vast array of amenities including shops, cafes, restaurants, and traditional pubs. The renowned Waterford Greenway is close at hand, while beaches and a variety of sporting facilities are all within easy reach. This property offers a discerning purchaser the opportunity of acquiring a most convenient town centre apartment. The accommodation comprises: Entrance hallway (with storage press off), open plan Living / Dining room with kitchenette area off, 2 bedrooms and shower room.\n\nREA Spratt highly recommend viewing of this impressive apartment. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n5.76m x 1.10m Timber floor with storage press off\n\nSitting/Dining\n6.25m x 3.54m Floor combination of timber and tiling, marble raised hearth for imitation fire surround, kitchenette off\n\nKitchenette\n2.46m x 1.70m Well designed to optimise space and functionality, tiled floor. Floor and eye level units, integrates appliances. Mechanical extractor\n\nBedroom 1\n3.80m x 2.65m Timber floor, built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2\n2.70m x 2.30m Timber floor, built in wardrobe\n\nShower Room\n2.20m x 1.70m Floor and walls partially tiled, Mira Electric shower\n\n\nOutside\n-Refuse Area"
      },
